{"type":"message","id":"27ea0d71","parentId":"3a1f95a1","timestamp":"2026-02-23T08:08:18.324Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"          ### 4. 安装说明和依赖"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_5cb9deda86d142b6bca8ae35","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"D:\\工作报告\\setup_integration.md","content":"# OpenClaw ↔ Browser-Use-Main 集成指南\n\n## 🎯 集成架构\n\n```\nOpenClaw (控制层) → BrowserAutomationBridge (桥接层) → Browser-Use-Main (执行层) → 真实浏览器\n```\n\n## 📦 安装步骤\n\n### 1. 安装Browser-Use-Main依赖\n```bash\ncd D:\\666666_kingwork\\browser-use-main\\browser-use-main\npip install -e .\n```\n\n### 2. 安装额外依赖\n```bash\npip install playwright\nplaywright install chromium\n```\n\n### 3. 验证安装\n```bash\npython -c \"import browser_use; print('Browser-Use安装成功')\"\n```\n\n## 🚀 使用方法\n\n### 通过OpenClaw调用\n```python\n# 在OpenClaw环境中调用\nfrom openclaw_browser_bridge import openclaw_browser_command\n\n# 抖音搜索\nresult = openclaw_browser_command(\"douyin_search\", keyword=\"AI\", count=5)\n\n# 百度搜索  \nresult = openclaw_browser_command(\"baidu_search\", keyword=\"人工智能\")\n\n# 浏览视频\nresult = openclaw_browser_command(\"browse_videos\", platform=\"douyin\", keyword=\"AI\", count=10)\n```\n\n### 直接Python调用\n```python\nfrom openclaw_browser_bridge import BrowserAutomationBridge\n\nbridge = BrowserAutomationBridge()\n\n# 执行抖音任务\nresult = bridge.douyin_search(\"AI\", 5)\nprint(result)\n```\n\n## 🔧 可用任务类型\n\n| 任务类型 | 参数 | 描述 |\n|---------|------|------|\n| `douyin_search` | `keyword`, `count` | 抖音搜索和浏览 |\n| `baidu_search` | `keyword` | 百度搜索和结果提取 |\n| `browse_videos` | `platform`, `keyword`, `count` | 多平台视频浏览 |\n| `extract_data` | `url`, `selector` | 网页数据提取 |\n\n## ⚙️ 配置说明\n\n### 浏览器设置\n- **headless模式**: 可配置显示/无头浏览器\n- **超时时间**: 默认10分钟任务超时\n- **并发控制**: 支持多个浏览器实例\n\n### 路径配置\n- Browser-Use-Main路径: `D:\\666666_kingwork\\browser-use-main\\browser-use-main`\n- 工作目录: `D:\\工作报告`\n- 脚本输出: 自动保存到工作目录\n\n## 🐛 故障排除\n\n### 常见问题\n1. **依赖缺失**: 运行 `pip install -e .` 安装所有依赖\n2. **浏览器无法启动**: 检查Playwright安装 `playwright install chromium`\n3. **路径错误**: 确认browser-use-main路径正确\n\n### 调试模式\n```python\n# 启用详细日志\nimport logging\nlogging.basicConfig(level=logging.DEBUG)\n```\n\n## 📊 性能优化\n\n1. **浏览器复用**: 保持浏览器会话避免重复启动\n2. **请求缓存**: 对重复请求使用缓存结果\n3. **并发控制**: 限制同时运行的浏览器实例数量\n\n## 🔒 安全考虑\n\n- 限制访问的域名白名单\n- 监控资源使用情况\n- 设置最大运行时间防止无限循环\n\n---\n\n**集成状态**: ✅ 就绪\n**最后测试**: 2026-02-23\n**维护者**: 红孩儿"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":44627,"output":874,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":45501,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771834055806}}
